it runs fine here without issues. make sure you have the most recent
testing version (and R-4.2), and if you're on linux/mac, then make sure
to register for the PARDISO library; see

	inla.pardiso()

AND, do

library(INLA)
inla.setOption(inla.mode = "experimental")

the results looks good to me. I ran it on our server in about 25
seconds.

